WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.050 --> 00:00:02.787
Welcome back to Building
the Daily Checks Workbook.

2
00:00:02.787 --> 00:00:05.750
This is Chapter 3: what
each tab would show.

3
00:00:05.750 --> 00:00:10.502
An empty queue over a source that stopped
arriving looks exactly like a quiet night,

4
00:00:10.502 --> 00:00:13.463
and the renderer in this
chapter says which one it is.

5
00:00:13.463 --> 00:00:17.183
We'll see what Microsoft Learn
and the operator runbook give you,

6
00:00:17.183 --> 00:00:20.552
the renderer's rules, and the
read-only reachability check,

7
00:00:20.552 --> 00:00:23.500
then walk two mornings in
the fictional workspace.

8
00:00:23.500 --> 00:00:26.599
The chapter is a draft
awaiting the owner's review,

9
00:00:26.599 --> 00:00:30.050
and the code is illustrative,
tested against fixtures.
